html: EPUB 3 footnotes out of the text flow, noteref links flagged

An <aside epub:type="footnote"> (also "endnote", "rearnote") showed
inline after the paragraph that cites it (#6431). Move such notes to the
end of the body, under a separator, where links still reach them, and
set FZ_LINK_FLAG_NOTEREF on links from <a epub:type="noteref">, so the
app shows the note in a popup instead of jumping to it.
